# 1️⃣1️⃣ Implemented CI With GitHub Actions

The next step was automating the software delivery process.

I created a GitHub Actions workflow to automate tasks such as:

```text
Git Push
   ↓
GitHub Actions
   ↓
Checkout Code
   ↓
Setup Go
   ↓
Install Dependencies
   ↓
Run Tests
   ↓
Static Analysis
   ↓
Build Application
   ↓
Build Docker Image
   ↓
Security Scan
   ↓
Push Image to Docker Hub
```

This removed the need to manually perform these steps after every code change.

