# 1️⃣4️⃣ CI vs CD in This Project

## Continuous Integration

Handled primarily by:

```text
GitHub Actions
```

Responsibilities:

* Code checkout
* Go setup
* Dependency installation
* Testing
* Static checks
* Docker image build
* Security scanning
* Image publishing

---

## Continuous Delivery / Deployment

Handled using:

```text
Argo CD
```

Responsibilities:

* Monitor Git repository
* Compare desired and live Kubernetes state
* Detect configuration drift
* Synchronize application state
* Deploy Kubernetes changes

