# 🧠 What This Project Demonstrates

The main objective of this project was not simply to deploy a Go application.

It demonstrates how DevOps practices can be applied to an application throughout its lifecycle:

```text
Develop
   ↓
Build
   ↓
Test
   ↓
Containerize
   ↓
Scan
   ↓
Publish
   ↓
Package
   ↓
Deploy
   ↓
Monitor Desired State
   ↓
Continuously Deliver
```

By combining **Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, AWS EKS, GitHub Actions, Docker Hub, Trivy/Docker Scout, and Argo CD**, the project demonstrates a complete application delivery workflow from source code to a GitOps-managed Kubernetes deployment.
